{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"乃木坂1の乃木坂ヲタク\nかりんの発音 上り坂↑\n伊藤かりん↑です(っｴ`o)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/karin.itou/img/blog/karin.itou/img/2017/03/07/5701775/0000.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"さあ。みなさま。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"少し前にモバメで\n大きなお仕事をしたと\n送ったことを覚えていますか？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そのお仕事とは\n「有吉ゼミ」のロケでした！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"有吉ゼミSP 日本テレビ\n3月13日  19:00～20:54"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"有吉ゼミの人気企画である\nギャル曽根さんの大食い企画に\n参加させていただきました！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"テラ盛り油そば食べて来ましたよ＼( 'ω')／"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"結果は見て頂いての\nお楽しみということで！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"たぶん私自身初のゴールデンタイムの\nバラエティ出演です！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ぜひご覧ください＼( 'ω')／"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"---------"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"またすぐブログ書きます！、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"か  り  ん  (っｴ`o)"}],"source":"archive"}